    <string name="permission_disclosure_body">Nova Dialer needs contacts access, including editing contacts, so it can identify callers, show names in Recents, and let you create or update a contact. To display and manage call history, Android requires Nova Dialer to be your default Phone app and to grant call-history access, including deleting entries when you ask. On a device with more than one SIM, phone-state access lets Nova Dialer identify each SIM and route a call to the SIM you choose. Notifications show the incoming-call screen and missed-call alerts. All information is processed on this device and is never uploaded or shared.</string>
